---
---
<section id="analytics">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="tag reveal">Measure What Matters</span>
    <h2 class="sec-title reveal">See Exactly What's Working — Then Do More Of It.</h2>
    <p class="sec-sub reveal">No more guessing where your leads come from. We wire up a proper tracking stack so you can see what people click, where they drop off, and what's quietly costing you money — all in plain English.</p>

    <div class="stack">

      <div class="stackcard reveal">
        <div class="cat">
          <span class="ick"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M8 17v-5M13 17V8M18 17v-9"/></svg></span>
          <div><span class="n">01</span><h3>Core Web Analytics</h3></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tool">
          <div class="top">
            <a class="name" href="https://marketingplatform.google.com/about/analytics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cursor>Google Analytics 4 <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"/></svg></a>
            <span class="pill free">Free</span>
          </div>
          <p>The gold standard for measuring website traffic, conversions and campaign performance — and it plugs straight into the Google Ads ecosystem.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tool">
          <div class="top">
            <a class="name" href="https://matomo.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cursor>Matomo <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"/></svg></a>
            <span class="pill">Open-Source</span>
          </div>
          <p>The top alternative when you need 100% data ownership, strict privacy compliance (GDPR) and cookieless tracking.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stackcard reveal">
        <div class="cat">
          <span class="ick"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3l7.07 16.97 2.51-7.39 7.39-2.51L3 3z"/></svg></span>
          <div><span class="n">02</span><h3>User Experience &amp; Behaviour</h3></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tool">
          <div class="top">
            <a class="name" href="https://clarity.microsoft.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cursor>Microsoft Clarity <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"/></svg></a>
            <span class="pill free">Free</span>
          </div>
          <p>A completely free tool that generates heatmaps and session recordings so you can see exactly how visitors navigate your pages.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tool">
          <div class="top">
            <a class="name" href="https://www.hotjar.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cursor>Hotjar <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"/></svg></a>
          </div>
          <p>A leading experience-analytics suite with session playbacks, funnel tracking and feedback surveys to pinpoint where people drop off.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stackcard reveal">
        <div class="cat">
          <span class="ick"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/></svg></span>
          <div><span class="n">03</span><h3>SEO &amp; Search Tracking</h3></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tool">
          <div class="top">
            <a class="name" href="https://search.google.com/search-console/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cursor>Google Search Console <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"/></svg></a>
            <span class="pill free">Free</span>
          </div>
          <p>A free essential from Google for tracking organic rankings, monitoring site health and seeing which keywords bring you visitors.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tool">
          <div class="top">
            <a class="name" href="https://www.semrush.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cursor>Semrush <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"/></svg></a>
          </div>
          <p>A comprehensive SEO platform for monitoring search presence, running site audits and analysing competitor website data.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stackcard reveal">
        <div class="cat">
          <span class="ick"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 4h18l-7 8v6l-4 2v-8L3 4z"/></svg></span>
          <div><span class="n">04</span><h3>SaaS &amp; Product Analytics</h3></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tool">
          <div class="top">
            <a class="name" href="https://mixpanel.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cursor>Mixpanel <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"/></svg></a>
          </div>
          <p>Built for web and mobile apps — it measures what specific users do via advanced event tracking, funnels and retention reports.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tool">
          <div class="top">
            <a class="name" href="https://amplitude.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cursor>Amplitude <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"/></svg></a>
          </div>
          <p>A predictive analytics platform ideal for teams focused on deep user segmentation and optimising product features.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stackcard reveal">
        <div class="cat">
          <span class="ick"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.59 13.41 12 22l-9-9V3h10l7.59 7.59a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.82z"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="7.5" r="1.5"/></svg></span>
          <div><span class="n">05</span><h3>Tag Management</h3></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tool">
          <div class="top">
            <a class="name" href="https://tagmanager.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cursor>Google Tag Manager <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"/></svg></a>
            <span class="pill free">Free</span>
          </div>
          <p>A must-have central hub for managing and deploying every tracking code and pixel — without touching your site's source code.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tool">
          <div class="top">
            <a class="name" href="https://www.facebook.com/business/tools/meta-pixel" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-cursor>Meta (Facebook) Pixel <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"/></svg></a>
          </div>
          <p>Measures ad conversions, builds retargeting audiences and sharpens your Facebook &amp; Instagram ad spend.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
    {/*
      This line used to read "Tracking IDs Aren't Connected Yet". GA4
      (G-BGDW47PVSF) and the Meta Pixel (870957819396743) went live in
      Layout.astro on 2026-08-13, which made that false on our own homepage.
    */}
    <p class="stacknote reveal"><span class="blip"></span> Running on this very site — GA4 and the Meta Pixel are live here, not just something we sell.</p>
  </div>
</section>
